From 43c840cb86aee9cc2e93f12e16983ee4ae5969a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fengshuai <shuai.feng@sunmi.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:00:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] feat(file-reference): carry drag payloads and canonical
 reference paths

Adds the private DataTransfer payload (serialize/parse/text fallback) so a Files-tree drop can reach the composer, and lets a candidate declare referencePath so a virtual query path inserts the Host-authorized canonical path. ui-reference uses that pair for .dsh-sources crumbs and queryMention.
